<exercise>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      What are the possible number of solutions to a system of linear equations?
    </p>
  </introduction>
</exercise>
<exercise workspace="0.01in">
 <introduction>
  <p>
    For each tyep of solutions, choose 1 system of equations and look at the table outputs side-by-side. Look for a pattern to describe each type of solution. Show the tables and your thinking below.
  </p>
 </introduction>
</exercise>
