<exercise workspace=".5in">
  <introduction>
    <p>
      In your own words, how do you know you have a system with 1...0...infiite solutions if you are looking at equations?
    </p>
  </introduction>
</exercise>
<exercise workspace=".5in">
  <introduction>
    <p>
      In your own words, how do you know you have a system with 1...0...infiite solutions if you are looking at a graph?
    </p>
  </introduction>
</exercise>
<exercise workspace=".5in">
  <introduction>
    <p>
      In your own words, how do you know you have a system with 1...0...infiite solutions if you are looking at a table of solutions?
    </p>
  </introduction>
</exercise>
